WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:07.900
What's wrong, Chiaki?

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.160
You don't look well.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.320
The next lesson is...

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.810
Oh?

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:18.780
I can understand how Chiaki is feeling.

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:23.200
It's hot and UV rays are a girl's archenemy.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.920
Yup, yup.

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:46.320
Come on! Let's clean the swimming pool!

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:49.750
Shuichi, look at how well I can use the brush.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.660
I can make this pool really clean in a few moments!

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:54.830
I'll leave it to you then...

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:59.680
Minami! You're not cleaning?!

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.000
Huh?

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.900
If I were to start cleaning,

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.880
the pool would be used again. Idiot.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:10.180
Speaking of which, Chiaki doesn't swim...

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:21.560
Chiaki?

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:27.860
Chiaki...?

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:34.990
If it's only Chiaki slacking around,

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:36.620
for a pool of this size, I can--

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:37.730
How naive.

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.750
Huh? Why?

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:43.360
One who controls the water source controls the swimming pool.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:46.390
One who controls the water source controls the cleaning!

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:47.380
Huh?!

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:51.330
I just have to hold onto this hose and cleaning cannot continue.

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:52.940
Come and get it.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.780
She wants us to get it? How?

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:57.640
If this goes on, the floor will dry up.

00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:00.370
Come on. What's wrong with you all?

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:03.140
I don't like being being annoyed,

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:06.020
but I really hate it when I get ignored.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.280
Come at me.

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:09.640
She wants our attention...

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:11.890
Yeah. What should we do?

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.010
Come over, both of you.

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:16.950
What is it, Yoshino?

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:20.970
Let me explain a bit.

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:22.040
Right!

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.550
Okay!

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:39.080
Makoto-kun, bring the water bucket here.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:40.690
We won't be able to continue cleaning otherwise.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:41.940
Understood!

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:45.030
Chiaki.

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:48.780
What?

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.430
We got it already,

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:51.740
so please return it to us.

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:55.870
You don't have to worry, Chiaki.

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:56.700
Eh?

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:59.120
Let's go to the pool in the neighboring town.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:01.290
We'll help you practice.

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:03.950
Really?

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:04.880
Yup!

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:07.220
I don't want tiring lessons!

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.880
I want proper coaching and--

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:10.480
I got it!

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:11.670
Wha-

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:12.960
You got careless!

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:16.550
I waited for that opportunity and got the hose!

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:17.600
Ah.

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:25.990
I see, I see...

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:27.840
So it was that kind of strategy...

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:30.940
S-S-Sorry, Minami... This...

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.990
Get used to the water, rather just learn...

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:38.600
...is what you're saying?

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.450
No, th-that's not...

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.290
So that's what it was, huh?

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.580
We'll get drenched!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.600
It's cold!
We'll get drenched!

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:47.290
It's cold!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.030
It feels so good!

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:50.800
A shower!

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:53.170
Don't turn it into something fun!

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:55.470
Here!

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:57.630
Hey, Yoshino!

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:01.640
Stop it! Stop it!

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:17.300
Somehow, everyone got drenched...

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:18.970
Looks like it.

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:25.460
Hey, that...

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:27.620
What is it?

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:31.940
Your... c-c-clothes.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:38.730
No!!!

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:46.240
Hey, Makoto. Bring the buckets over here.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:47.950
I knew this would happen,

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:49.480
so I've already brought them!

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:50.640
I see, very well.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.050
Good thinking there.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:52.860
Yes!

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:54.150
Just stand there like that.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:55.280
Yes!

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:00.570
It's tiring.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:01.920
I suppose.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.020
Uchida with a broom.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:09.160
Yoshino with a brush.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:10.420
Understood.

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:17.580
This isn't getting fun!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.090
I suppose.

00:06:57.940 --> 00:07:00.110
It's really hot!

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:02.860
Today's weather is really hot.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.490
Isn't it?

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:07.010
It's really hot~

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:08.750
Isn't it?

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:11.150
It's really hot~

00:07:11.150 --> 00:07:13.070
Can you stop repeating "It's really hot"?

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:15.420
You're making me feel hot too.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:17.420
But it's really hot!

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:22.520
The hotter it is, the better the P.E. lessons will feel!

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:24.810
You're right! It was swimming today.

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:26.750
After enduring such extreme heat,

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:30.060
you'll feel extremely good the moment you get in the water.

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:33.100
I see! That's it!

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:07.250
It's hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.260
Yes it is.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:11.780
How annoying.

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:14.580
Humans are supposed to be land animals.

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:17.630
Land animals do not need to swim.

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.690
It's fine not knowing how to swim.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:24.820
No... Of course knowing how to swim is good too...

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:25.870
Then again,

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:29.710
The human body was made to be able to float on water...

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:32.750
The human body...

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:35.280
All right!

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:06.710
70% of the body consists of water.

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:11.810
What would happen if it were to rise to 80%?

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:14.580
I would like to be as close as possible to water.

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:21.090
Did you know? Takeda-kun learned how to swim in a day.

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:22.800
Eh? Really?

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:25.340
It's true. You know, at the pool yesterday...

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:32.050
What's wrong, Chiaki,

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:34.070
for you to drink so much water...

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:43.250
It's impossible to hit 80%...

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:48.370
My personal drive will be enough for today's swimming lesson!

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:52.140
Do you all know of a Takeda?

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:54.330
Yeah...

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:58.060
It's said that he learned how to swim from yesterday's swimming class.

00:09:58.060 --> 00:10:00.580
Eh? That Takeda finally...

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:03.700
I can't turn back anymore...

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:04.750
Yes.

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:06.800
There's no turning back.

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:11.760
Watch me as I'm closer to water now.

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.190
Is it my imagination?

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:20.190
Because I drank a lot of water, my little tummy is bulging out.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:23.310
This expression...

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:26.210
I've never seen such a determined expression before!

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:30.490
I'll cheer you on, Chiaki!

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:33.200
Let's head to the pool with your determination!

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.620
Oh... hold on.

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:39.960
Before that, I need to go to the infirmary...

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:44.070
I wonder if she's feeling sick somewhere...

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:49.980
Kumada-sensei.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:52.640
Please don't question and just tie a bandage for me.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:04.110
Besides that, it's really hot today!

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:05.650
Kumada-sensei...

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:07.780
Your classes are so good, Chiaki.

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:09.610
It's swimming lessons next, right?

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.740
Can you swim a bit?

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:15.870
Why are you questioning me, when I told you not to?!

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:17.570
Going to the pool is great...

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:18.580
Please tie a bandage for me quickly.
Going to the pool is great...

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:20.260
Please tie a bandage for me quickly.

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:27.920
All right.

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:30.750
Since everyone's attention will be focused on here!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:34.190
a little bulge in my tummy won't get noticed.

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:37.010
Hey, looks like Minami's stomach is bulging out today.

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:40.560
The water diversion level is just perfect.

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:42.790
Hey, what is water diversion?

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:45.100
Isn't it drinking water to help one float?

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:48.320
Today, I must...

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.690
Oh... Chiaki!

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.470
Uchida, Yoshino.

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:53.990
Are you all right?

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:55.680
I'm completely fine.

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:57.900
Today, I'm water itself.

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:00.540
What wrong with that finger?

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:03.660
Oh, this is just a small bruise.

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:07.690
If you're hurt, you better not swim.

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:12.260
That's right. It's not good to overexert yourself.

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:15.060
You can just watch and learn today, Chiaki.

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:22.480
No, I must not cry! It wasn't easy raising my water levels...

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:24.860
Even after you had such determination...

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:27.120
Summer has just started.

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:32.280
It feels great!

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:34.490
It's so hot, that's why it feels great.

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:51.210
It's really hot.

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:09.400
The school's swimming lesson isn't enough.

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:12.220
I wanted to swim some more.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:13.570
Oh! That's it!

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:16.050
Let's go to a pool other than the school's pool tomorrow.

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:16.900
It's a holiday anyway.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:18.180
Pool?

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:19.270
Yeah!

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:26.870
I'm going!

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:29.200
All right. What about you, Keiko?

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.650
Yeah, I'll go as well.

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:33.200
It's settled!

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:37.370
Let's play as much as possible at the deepest part of the pool!

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.140
Somehow I don't feel like going...

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:43.420
All right. We must start preparing immediately.

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:47.100
Eh?

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:49.970
Hey... Kana.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:51.520
What about the rest?

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:53.690
Are we not inviting anyone else?

00:13:56.640 --> 00:14:00.110
Huh? I thought she'd definitely invite Fujioka-kun...

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.850
That's why I said I was going...

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:05.060
What wrong, Riko?

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:12.410
If it's like this, I'll have to lead Kana on to invite Fujioka!

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:17.300
I just heard Minami talking about going to the pool...

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:20.180
I want to go too!

00:14:20.180 --> 00:14:22.460
Hey, doesn't this look good?

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:25.180
This pair of sports shoes is pretty good.

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:28.100
I think its spikes look nice.

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:32.810
It's expensive... I'm not sure if my parents would buy one for me.

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:37.260
If I show an interest in going to the pool...

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:39.560
I might get invited.

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:42.660
While going to the pool is great,

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:44.810
just the three of us will be...

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:47.660
It'll be a little... You know...

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:50.730
I feel like going to the pool.

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:53.550
That pool lesson wasn't enough.

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:55.470
Didn't you say that just now?

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.920
But it really is hot.

00:14:57.920 --> 00:14:58.920
Isn't it?

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:02.220
I really feel like going to some pool outside school.

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:04.560
I feel like going to the pool!

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:06.930
With everyone together, if possible!

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:09.220
I really want to go to the pool!

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.440
I'm free tomorrow...

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:14.350
These two seem to be doing it purposely...

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:17.940
Is it because I know their true feelings?

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.010
Even so...

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:23.740
...you can't blame the clueless Kana for not understanding that chatter.

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:26.160
It always takes so long to dry.

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:27.450
Notice it, Kana!

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:29.450
You're a sensitive girl!

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:30.460
I think...

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:35.890
I can go over and invite Fujioka-kun...

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:38.840
...but that's kind of embarrassing... I can't do it.

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:44.840
Three person is too few. Should we ask someone?

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:49.680
After all, it's more interesting if there are more people.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:52.640
It'll be better for close friends to come...

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:53.660
Yes, yes.

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:56.690
It'll be really good if we can go with some guys.

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:03.840
Many people...

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:06.190
Close friends...

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.450
With some guys...

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:12.120
Won't that be...

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:20.010
I'm sorry about that.

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:22.080
I was too impulsive.

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:24.760
Let's forget it.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:28.000
I'll go with my sister's friends.

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:31.560
All of you feel that the school's pool is great,

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:33.890
and don't want to go to other pools.

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:38.400
How did it turn out like this?!

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:42.390
H-Huh? Huh?! Where did I go wrong?

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:46.780
She's out of bed already?

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:49.270
Oh! Good morning, Chiaki.

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:52.450
You can still wake up so early during holidays, not bad!

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:53.990
Good morning, Chiaki!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:19:02.530
It's such a rare sight for a sleeping beauty like you to wake up early.

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:06.960
She only wakes up early when she wants to play.

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.930
Why aren't you following me?!

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:56.640
Y-You know...

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:29.570
Hey Fujioka...

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:32.140
Fujioka?

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:36.480
Oh! Wh-What?

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:38.530
It seems like Kana is in a bad mood...

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:40.620
Did you do something?

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.320
That's probably because...

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:49.700
...a few people went to the pool yesterday,

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:52.150
we weren't sure how to play tag.

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:55.450
When I was <i>it</i>,

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:58.370
Kana asked angrily, "Do you want to play or not?"

00:20:58.370 --> 00:20:59.910
I think it was that reason.

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:03.080
Why didn't you want to play?

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:04.780
It wasn't whether I wanted to play or not!

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:07.580
It's hard to tag others at the pool.

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:10.880
So that's it.

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:13.650
Besides you, the others were all females.

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:15.140
Yeah.

00:21:15.140 --> 00:21:18.010
You were <i>it</i>, and you were shy.

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:18.850
Yeah.

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:23.060
Your whole face turns red when you blush.

00:21:26.310 --> 00:21:29.340
Okay, Fujioka. I will give you a demonstration.

00:21:29.340 --> 00:21:30.270
Demonstration?

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:31.880
Hey, Chiaki.

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:34.840
Huh? What is it?

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:36.050
Touch.

00:21:36.050 --> 00:21:36.780
Huh?

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:39.150
There, it's simple.

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:41.970
Yeah, but...

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:44.890
The one who suggested the game of tag was Kana.

00:21:44.890 --> 00:21:47.210
You don't need to be shy. Just catch her.

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:48.920
Touch.

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:56.100
You little fellow. You did it!

00:21:56.100 --> 00:21:57.720
All right!

00:21:58.530 --> 00:22:00.390
Touch!

00:22:01.190 --> 00:22:02.370
Touch.

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:04.170
Touch.

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:05.230
Ah!!!

00:22:05.230 --> 00:22:08.270
What are you doing? That was dangerous!

00:22:08.270 --> 00:22:11.140
You'll understand this in three years, Touma.

00:22:12.110 --> 00:22:15.190
Many problems arise from touching a girl.

00:22:17.160 --> 00:22:20.260
No matter what I say, I'm still a girl.

00:22:21.410 --> 00:22:22.780
Touch.

00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:27.300
Touch.

00:22:27.300 --> 00:22:28.770
Touch!

00:22:28.770 --> 00:22:31.550
Touch.

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:35.380
Ah!!! Didn't I say that was dangerous?!

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:37.290
